  "description": "2025 Winter Showcase This event has concluded Sign up Below! The 2025 Winter Showcase hosted by Spindles United FC Sunday, January 19, 2025 3-5pm | $5 per player Afrim’s Sports…",
  "bodyHtml": "<figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/3cee82ca-3b50-402e-9d73-4a08d08d6a67/Screenshot+2025-01-04+at+11.09.24%E2%80%AFAM.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>This event has concluded</span></h4></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/8e2af700-f319-4e84-90d8-43fad46f3e80/winter-showcase.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"Poster for Winter Showcase event featuring the Spindles United football team, scheduled for Sunday, January 19, 2025, from 3 to 5 pm at Afrim&#x27;s Sports Malta. The poster includes an image of a red tent with the Spindles United logo and several football players in the background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Sign up Below!</h3></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The 2025 Winter Showcase hosted by Spindles United FC</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>Sunday, January 19, 2025</em></strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>3-5pm | $5 per player</em></strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"https://www.afrimsports.com/afrims-malta/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Afrim’s Sports Malta</em></strong></a><strong><em> | Must sign Afrim’s Waiver</em></strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><strong>2-Hour Scrimmage Session</strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>3:00pm</em></strong><em> - Intro and Warm up</em></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>3:15pm</em></strong><em> - Fast paced, 6v6, 3 minute game rotations</em></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>4:00pm</em></strong><em> - 7v7, 10-15 minute game rotations</em></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>5:00pm</em></strong><em> - Closing</em></p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/054b591d-2f5d-44c5-ad94-438d18c206fa/6-15-grassroots-663.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>To kick off 2025, Spindles is hosting our first open showcase of the year for the upcoming season.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>As held in the past, this scrimmage-based event is an opportunity for players to show their interest in joining the Spindles in 2025.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Spindles United operates on a Clean-Slate system each season to help level the playing field for both former and potential players.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Sign up below to save your spot!</span></p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Registration is Closed</h2><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">This event has concluded</p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/8d092131-02bb-4fee-a022-213daaaa477b/12-2+Scarves-096.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Win a Free Scarf!</span></h3></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>One player at the 2025 Winter Showcase will be randomly selected for a FREE Spindles Scarf</span></p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Past Showcases</h3></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Read about our past showcase events!</p></div><figure><a href=\"/news/2023-spring-tryouts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/9aa22673-dee3-4872-9e9e-fcd28c0a13d6/spring-tryouts-76.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"Group of young soccer players and coaches on a soccer field posing for a team photo in front of a goalpost, wearing team jerseys and training vests.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"/news/2023-spring-tryouts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2023 Spring Tryouts</a></h3></div><figure><a href=\"/news/2024-fall-showcase\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/67f8bcbf-1e94-4eba-b004-43b4616ff313/Screenshot+2025-01-05+at+11.10.03%E2%80%AFAM.png?format=original\" alt=\"Soccer players practicing on a field, wearing pink and green jerseys with &#x27;SPINDLES UNITED&#x27; written on them, with buildings in the background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"/news/2024-fall-showcase\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2024 Fall Showcase</a></h3></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"https://www.afrimsports.com/afrims-malta/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Afrim’s Sports Malta</em></strong></a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">2381 US-9</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Mechanicville, NY</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">12118</p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/fd6e9da6-e059-446e-a13e-8f718632a984/vmacocss05_1224617493090-1-0.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure>",
